{
  "title": "Nutty Peruvian Rice Vermicelli Rocoto Relleno",
  "description": "A buttery and shaggy Peruvian dish featuring rice vermicelli, made diabetic-friendly and cooked to perfection in a binchotan grill, filled with flavorful ingredients inside a rocoto pepper vessel.",
  "cuisine": "Peruvian",
